
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>500 - Internal Server Error | LetsStudy Pro</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{
  margin:0;
  min-height:100vh;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:20px;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#f1f5f9;
  color:#0f172a;
}

.container{
  width:100%;
  max-width:600px;
  padding:45px 30px;
  background:white;
  text-align:center;
  border-radius:20px;
  box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
}

.logo{
  font-size:23px;
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#2563eb;
  margin-bottom:35px;
}

.icon{
  width:85px;
  height:85px;
  margin:0 auto 20px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#fee2e2;
  color:#dc2626;
  font-size:40px;
}

.code{
  font-size:100px;
  font-weight:800;
  color:#dc2626;
  line-height:1;
  margin:15px 0;
}

h1{
  font-size:27px;
  margin:20px 0 12px;
}

p{
  color:#64748b;
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.info{
  margin:25px 0;
  padding:16px;
  background:#fff7ed;
  border:1px solid #fed7aa;
  border-radius:10px;
  color:#9a3412;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.buttons{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:12px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:25px;
}

a{
  text-decoration:none;
  padding:13px 20px;
  border-radius:9px;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.primary{
  background:#2563eb;
  color:white;
}

.secondary{
  background:#e2e8f0;
  color:#334155;
}

footer{
  margin-top:35px;
  font-size:12px;
  color:#94a3b8;
}

@media(max-width:480px){
  .container{padding:35px 20px}
  .code{font-size:75px}
  h1{font-size:23px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

  <div class="logo">LetsStudy Pro</div>

  <div class="icon">⚙</div>

  <div class="code">500</div>

  <h1>Internal Server Error</h1>

  <p>
    Something went wrong while processing your request.
    Our system could not complete the operation at this time.
  </p>

  <div class="info">
    <strong>What can you do?</strong><br>
    Please try again in a few moments. If the problem
    continues, contact the website administrator.
  </div>

  <div class="buttons">
    <a href="/" class="primary">Go to Homepage</a>
    <a href="javascript:location.reload()" class="secondary">Try Again</a>
  </div>

  <footer>
    LetsStudy Pro · Learn. Build. Work. Grow.
  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
